00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, but kayaking
isn't a place for fun.

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I go to Hydra, to Greece.
Yeah.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You go to Greece for fun?
-Sure.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
In my fantasy --
In my wild fantasy life.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're going to go to Greece
for kayaking.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you mean like to --
I go to Greece.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:06.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, Greece for kayaking.
-Yeah.

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.101 size:84% position:42% line:92%
