Type of relative?

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:30.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Granny. Auntie. Grandma.
-Grandma Auntie.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, good.
-Grandma Auntie!

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Famous singer?
-Pete Seeger!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ] Pete Seeger?
Yeah, I love him.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:40.767 size:84% position:42%
What you would shout
when you walk into your
own surprise party?

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:44.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I did this.
"I should've washed my hair."

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.171 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, nice.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what I did,
when I was 16.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.007 line:92%
-"I should've washed my hair."

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.510
-Someone threw me a party.
"I should've washed my hair."

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.845 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-That's a great line.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:54.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
Type of profession?
-Astronaut.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.549 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Astronaut.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.651 size:84% position:42% line:92%
A verb ending in I-N-G?

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.986 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Digging.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Digging.
-I'm digging.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.891 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Plural objects?

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:08.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, b-- bikinis. Bikinis.
-Bikinis.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:10.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was going to say pens,
but that's boring.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, bikinis is perfect.
Bikinis.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:15.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
