-France.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.437 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-A number?

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:20.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
-52.
Or nipples grew.

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or wait. What was that?
What was that?

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.645 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.682 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Adjective?

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:33.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, uh. Untrustworthy.
-Untrustworthy.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, that was beautiful.
-Ooh.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.224 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Plural animal?

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
