00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.634 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[Bleep] Dagnabbit!

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:50.703 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Dagnabbit. I love it.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.539 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
A plural body part?

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:55.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ears.
-Ears.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:56.743 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Another adjective?

00:02:56.743 --> 00:03:00.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Flashy. Flashy.
-Flashy.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.816 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Two words that rhyme?

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:07.086 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Um...

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I'm gonna go
"spies" and "eyes."

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.424 line:92%
-Spies and eyes. Very good.

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:13.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or I could do
"spies" and "despise."

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:16.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, spies and eyes are great.
