00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:18.798 line:92%
-Uh, deodorant. Deodorant.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Deodorant.
-Yeah, deodorant.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:22.468 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Deodorant. Very good.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
We've filled out
the words for our scene.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thrilling!
You guys seem riveted.

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.941
