00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:23.997 size:84% position:42%
Grandma Auntie lives
at Bob's Big Boy, yeah.

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:25.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God!
-Yeah.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:28.401 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ]

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.704 line:92%
I should've washed my hair!

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:34.207 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
